{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/datagravity-ai/kelos/pull/124","repo":"datagravity-ai/kelos","number":124,"set":"agent","source":"claude-code-open","title":"feat: add sidecarContainers to PodOverrides","body":"## Summary\n\n- Adds `sidecarContainers` field to the `PodOverrides` struct, allowing TaskSpawner configs to inject additional containers alongside the agent\n- Validates sidecar names against reserved Kelos container names (agent, git-clone, plugin, skills)\n- Sidecars share the pod's network namespace (accessible via localhost) and can mount user-supplied volumes\n\n## Motivation\n\nGravity agents currently cannot run unit tests because they lack a Postgres database. Adding sidecar support enables injecting an ephemeral Postgres container into agent pods, giving them full test-running capability without requiring changes to the agent image.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Verify CRD generation picks up the new field\n- [ ] Unit test that sidecar containers appear in the final Job spec\n- [ ] Unit test that reserved name validation rejects \"agent\", \"git-clone\", etc.\n- [ ] Integration test with a postgres:16-alpine sidecar\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","authorType":"Bot","additions":17732,"deletions":520,"changedFiles":87,"files":[{"path":".devcontainer/Dockerfile","additions":139,"deletions":0},{"path":".devcontainer/devcontainer.json","additions":50,"deletions":0},{"path":".devcontainer/post-create.sh","additions":21,"deletions":0},{"path":".githooks/check-secrets.sh","additions":95,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/ci-anomalo.yaml","additions":64,"deletions":0},{"path":".github/workflows/release-anomalo.yaml","additions":180,"deletions":0},{"path":"ANOMALO-CONTRIBUTING-GUIDE.md","additions":34,"deletions":0},{"path":"Makefile","additions":7,"deletions":2},{"path":"anomalo-claude-commands/kelos-cherry-pick-to-prod.md","additions":45,"deletions":0},{"path":"anomalo-claude-commands/kelos-new-branch.md","additio